me": "state_uid", "label": "state_uid", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "state_uid"}], "color": "#232", "widgets_values": ["Empty - Nothing", "you are an anime image prompt extractor for the anima model.\n\nyour task is to analyze anime illustrations and extract reconstruction-focused visual prompts, not to write art criticism or emotional summaries.\n\nonly describe visible visual facts. do not guess identity, story, personality, artist, or hidden meaning.\n\nprioritize concrete reconstruction traits:\ncomposition, camera angle, perspective, cropping, pose, silhouette, hand gesture, foreground overlap, hair shape, hair color mix, eye design, facial markings, clothing structure, accessories, props, background graphics, lighting direction, color palette, contrast, rendering style.\n\navoid vague or subjective words:\nbeautiful, cool, cute, amazing, stylish, dramatic, dynamic feeling, visually striking, artistic, emotional, atmosphere.\n\nreplace vague words with concrete visual terms:\nlow-angle perspective, top-down view, extreme close-up, foreshortened hand, oversized glove, split-color hair, glowing iris, thick eyeliner, rim lighting, flat color background, geometric shapes, layered clothing, asymmetrical sleeves, translucent ribbons, high contrast cel shading.\n\noutput must be useful for anima prompting. use english lowercase tags first, then a short factual caption. do not use chinese.", "analyze this anime illustration for anima reconstruction.\n\noutput exactly 2 sections:\n\n[tags]\nwrite 40 to 90 english lowercase tags, separated by commas.\nfocus on specific visible details, not generic labels.\ninclude:\ncamera angle, perspective, composition, cropping, pose, hand position, foreground and background relationship, hair structure, hair colors, eye details, facial details, clothing structure, accessories, props, background elements, lighting, color palette, contrast, rendering style.\n\ndo not use vague filler tags such as beautiful, cool, cute, colorful, dynamic, dramatic, aesthetic, amazing, high quality, sharp focus.\ndo not mention artist names.\ndo not invent unseen details.\n\n[caption]\nwrite 2 to 3 short english sentences.\ndescribe the composition and key visual structure only.\nfocus on concrete visual details that help recreate the image.\navoid emotional interpretation and abstract art commentary.", "one by one", 24, 256, 121849151118174, "randomize", false, false], "inputs": [{"name": "llama_model", "link": 17, "label": "llama_model", "type": "LLAMACPPMODEL", "localized_name": "llama_model"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "parameters", "link": 18, "label": "parameters", "type": "LLAMACPPARAMS", "localized_name": "parameters"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "images", "link": 28, "label": "images", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "images"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "queue_handler", "label": "queue_handler", "type": "*", "localized_name": "queue_handler"}, {"widget": {"name": "preset_prompt"}, "name": "preset_prompt", "label": "preset_prompt", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "preset_prompt"}, {"widget": {"name": "custom_prompt"}, "name": "custom_prompt", "label": "custom_prompt", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "custom_prompt"}, {"widget": {"name": "system_prompt"}, "name": "system_prompt", "label": "system_prompt", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "system_prompt"}, {"widget": {"name": "inference_mode"}, "name": "inference_mode", "label": "inference_mode", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "inference_mode"}, {"widget": {"name": "max_frames"}, "name": "max_frames", "label": "max_frames", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "max_frames"}, {"widget": {"name": "max_size"}, "name": "max_size", "label": "max_size", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "max_size"}, {"widget": {"name": "seed"}, "name": "seed", "label": "seed", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "seed"}, {"widget": {"name": "force_offload"}, "name": "force_offload", "label": "force_offload", "type": "BOOLEAN", "localized_name": "force_offload"}, {"widget": {"name": "